The function splits the query string on '&' to get each key‑value pair, then splits each pair on the first '=' to separate key and value. Both key and value are URL‑decoded using `urllib.parse.unquote_plus`, which also converts '+' to a space. If a key appears multiple times, its values are collected into a list; otherwise the single value is stored directly.

