js-032.text:
I will implement `sleepless` by iterating over the provided array of promise‑returning functions, awaiting each one in sequence so that the results are collected in the same order as the input tasks. This approach handles edge cases such as an empty task list (returning an empty array) and ensures that any rejected promise propagates correctly, preserving the original order of successful results.

